      "captions": [
        {
          "start": 0,
          "end": 5.724814814814815,
          "text": "Well, I mean it, of course, in relative terms.\nThe history of man so far is nothing to brag"
        },
        {
          "start": 5.724814814814815,
          "end": 11.323809523809524,
          "text": "about, from the standpoint of our ideas--and\nwhat I mean is, that in comparison with most"
        },
        {
          "start": 11.323809523809524,
          "end": 16.293703703703706,
          "text": "other societies, our present-day American\nsociety has achieved things which are"
        },
        {
          "start": 16.293703703703706,
          "end": 21.76687830687831,
          "text": "remarkable: material wealth, greater than for\nany other nation; a relative freedom from"
        },
        {
          "start": 21.76687830687831,
          "end": 23.780000000000005,
          "text": "oppression; a relative mobility;"
        }
      ],
      "text": "Well, I mean it, of course, in relative terms. The history of man so far is nothing to brag about, from the standpoint of our ideas--and what I mean is, that in comparison with most other societies, our present-day American society has achieved things which are remarkable: material wealth, greater than for any other nation; a relative freedom from oppression; a relative mobility;"
    },
