      "captions": [
        {
          "start": 0,
          "end": 5.614999999999995,
          "text": "Well, there is a creative pleasure, which, for\ninstance, the artisan in the Middle Ages, or"
        },
        {
          "start": 5.614999999999995,
          "end": 11.168296703296694,
          "text": "in a country like Mexico, still today has -\nnamely the pleasure of creating something. You"
        },
        {
          "start": 11.168296703296694,
          "end": 16.413076923076908,
          "text": "find quite a few skilled workers who still\nhave that pleasure: maybe in a steel mill;"
        },
        {
          "start": 16.413076923076908,
          "end": 21.842967032967014,
          "text": "maybe a worker who works with a complicated\nmachine - he has a sense that he is creating"
        },
        {
          "start": 21.842967032967014,
          "end": 22.45999999999998,
          "text": "something."
        }
      ],
      "text": "Well, there is a creative pleasure, which, for instance, the artisan in the Middle Ages, or in a country like Mexico, still today has - namely the pleasure of creating something. You find quite a few skilled workers who still have that pleasure: maybe in a steel mill; maybe a worker who works with a complicated machine - he has a sense that he is creating something."
    }
